[h1]Sentinel Deathmatch - Sentinel Bridge [ALPHA][/h1]

[b]Server-side companion for Sentinel Deathmatch.[/b] Clients do NOT need this item - do not add it to your client mod list.

Streams Sentinel Deathmatch round, kill, and vote events to the Sentinel platform when your server also runs the Sentinel Enforcer. This powers server-side stats on dayz.fyi and, later in the alpha, the global cross-server deathmatch leaderboard.

[h2]Requirements[/h2]
[list]
[*]Sentinel Deathmatch (the main mod) in -mod=
[*]Sentinel Enforcer in -serverMod=, registered with the Sentinel platform
[*]This item in -serverMod=
[/list]

[h2]Configuration[/h2]
First boot writes [b]$profile:SentinelDeathmatch\sentinel.json[/b]:
[list]
[*][b]EventFeed[/b] - master switch for the dm.* event stream
[*][b]GlobalLeaderboard[/b] - opt in/out of ranked participation
[/list]
The feed also respects the Enforcer's own enable switch and per-event capture flags - if your Enforcer is disabled, this bridge sends nothing.

[h2]Source[/h2]
This bridge is also the reference example for pushing your own mod's events to the Sentinel platform: https://github.com/mierst/sentinel-deathmatch (addons/dm_sentinel). Powered by Sentinel.
